  "author_notes": "Setup kit: supply both discs of the listed Redump set (CUE/BIN or CHD) and your own SCPH1001 BIOS dump. Setup starts from Disc 1; change discs in game from the F1 menu (Disc > Change disc). The game reads saves from memory card slot 1 only. Windows setup and gameplay were tested with the published package; Linux x64 and macOS x64 setup and start-up were checked by automated replay; macOS ARM64 is built only. Known issue: after a CHD setup the launcher disc selector can show Disc 2 as failing verification; the in-game F1 disc change works. Netplay is not qualified.",
